      ],
      "devanagari": "स तु हर्षात् तम् उद्देशम् जन ओघो विपुलः प्रयान् |\nअशोभत महा वेगः सागरस्य इव पर्वणि",
      "iast": "sa tu harṣāt tam uddeśam jana ogho vipulaḥ prayān |\naśobhata mahā vegaḥ sāgarasya iva parvaṇi",
      "translation": "That mighty assembly of men gladly setting out to that forest was splendid like an ocean on the day of the full moon having a gigantic commotion.",
